<title>USA: Omaha cattle off $1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle off $1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said slaughter steers and heifers were $1.00 lower.</p>
<p>Steers - select to choice 2-4 1000-1350 lbs 68.50-69.50, few 70.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - select to mostly choice 2-4 975-1250 lbs 68.50-69.50, few 70.00.</p>
</text>
